:markdown
  Hi #{@user.username},

  This is a final reminder that Nitrous Lite will be shut down completely on July 30, 2015.

  You have #{@boxes.size} remaining #{'box'.pluralize(@boxes.size)} on Nitrous Lite: #{@boxes.to_sentence}

  The above #{'box'.pluralize(@boxes.size)} will be terminated and no longer be
  available upon the shutdown of Nitrous Lite.

  We have prepared various solutions for you depending on your needs.  Please choose from the below:

  1. I want to continue with the Nitrous experience
  2. I just want to get my data out of my remaining boxes
  3. I do not care about the data on my remaining boxes
  4. None of the above -- my needs are not covered here

  #### Option 1

  We have made this easy for you.

  We're offering you a free month of Nitrous Pro, and have already set up an
  account for you with these credentials:

  - Username: #{@new_username}
  - E-mail: #{@user.email}

  All you have to do is set a new password here:

  #{@reset_url}

  Once logged in, you can create a workspace and follow the guide below to
  migrate your Lite box(es) to Pro.

  [https://community.nitrous.io/docs/migrate-your-box-from-nitrous-lite-to-nitrous-pro](https://community.nitrous.io/docs/migrate-your-box-from-nitrous-lite-to-nitrous-pro)

  #### Option 2

  2. If you only wish to backup your data without a new account, you can find a
  guide on doing so at

  [https://community.nitrous.io/docs/backing-up-your-nitrous-lite-data](https://community.nitrous.io/docs/backing-up-your-nitrous-lite-data).

  #### Option 3

  No further action is needed on your part.

  #### Option 4

  Please contact us at [support@nitrous.io](mailto:support@nitrous.io).

  --

  We hope to see you on [Nitrous Pro](https://pro.nitrous.io) soon!

  Cheers,<br>
  The Nitrous Team
